Dialogue: 3,0:21:55.25,0:22:01.31,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}我能就像現在這樣嗎
Dialogue: 3,0:22:01.31,0:22:02.90,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}好想被愛
Dialogue: 3,0:22:02.90,0:22:09.31,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}哪怕拋下我所熟悉的世界
Dialogue: 3,0:22:09.73,0:22:12.99,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}從未和他人拼湊在一起
Dialogue: 3,0:22:12.99,0:22:15.80,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}訴說著話語  卻無法溝通
Dialogue: 3,0:22:15.80,0:22:18.54,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}無法融入這世界的「理所當然」
Dialogue: 3,0:22:18.54,0:22:20.77,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}也找不到歸處
Dialogue: 3,0:22:21.03,0:22:24.24,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}沒有人和我同甘共苦
Dialogue: 3,0:22:24.24,0:22:26.87,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}總是顧及別人的視線
Dialogue: 3,0:22:26.87,0:22:29.69,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}不停地  不停地
Dialogue: 3,0:22:29.69,0:22:32.19,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}在自己身上塗改
Dialogue: 3,0:22:32.19,0:22:35.32,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}將自己的名字刻在心裡
Dialogue: 3,0:22:35.32,0:22:39.30,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}將那個不能做自己的我
Dialogue: 3,0:22:40.50,0:22:45.55,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}留在過去
Dialogue: 3,0:22:49.60,0:22:55.52,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)}我要做我自己
Dialogue: 3,0:22:55.52,0:22:57.73,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)}跨越每一片大海  自由地奔跑
Dialogue: 3,0:22:57.73,0:23:00.97,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)}離開這逼仄的世界
Dialogue: 3,0:23:00.97,0:23:06.78,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)}渴求著愛而顫抖著的心
Dialogue: 3,0:23:07.19,0:23:11.28,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)}將因照耀著明日的你
Dialogue: 3,0:23:11.75,0:23:14.13,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)}而熠熠生輝
Dialogue: 3,0:23:17.07,0:23:25.43,ED - CN - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,0)}我也一定會是某個人的光
Dialogue: 2,0:21:55.25,0:22:01.31,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}私は私のままで良いかな？
Dialogue: 2,0:22:01.31,0:22:02.90,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}愛されたい
Dialogue: 2,0:22:02.90,0:22:09.31,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}自分の知る世界を手放しても
Dialogue: 2,0:22:09.73,0:22:12.99,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}ほかの人と we never pieced together
Dialogue: 2,0:22:12.99,0:22:15.80,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}伝えても通じ合えない
Dialogue: 2,0:22:15.80,0:22:18.54,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}「普通」に馴染めなくて
Dialogue: 2,0:22:18.54,0:22:20.77,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}居場所さえない
Dialogue: 2,0:22:21.03,0:22:24.24,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}分かち合う人いなくて
Dialogue: 2,0:22:24.24,0:22:26.87,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}視線ばかり気にして
Dialogue: 2,0:22:26.87,0:22:29.69,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}ずっとずっと自分を
Dialogue: 2,0:22:29.69,0:22:32.19,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}書き換えていた
Dialogue: 2,0:22:32.19,0:22:35.32,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I write my name　刻んで
Dialogue: 2,0:22:35.32,0:22:39.30,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}ありのままじゃない自分を
Dialogue: 2,0:22:40.50,0:22:45.55,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}もう過去に置いてく
Dialogue: 2,0:22:49.60,0:22:55.52,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)}私は私のままでいたい
Dialogue: 2,0:22:55.52,0:22:57.73,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)}Crossing every sea, running free
Dialogue: 2,0:22:57.73,0:23:00.97,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)}狭い世界離れて
Dialogue: 2,0:23:00.97,0:23:06.78,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)}愛されたくて　ふるえる心は
Dialogue: 2,0:23:07.19,0:23:11.28,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)}明日を照らす君だけの
Dialogue: 2,0:23:11.75,0:23:14.13,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)}it's your wild glow
Dialogue: 2,0:23:17.07,0:23:25.43,ED - JP - EP11,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,0)}きっと誰かの光だから
