Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.32,0:22:39.30,ED - JP - EP11 - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\blur5}ありのままじゃない自分を
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.50,0:22:45.55,ED - JP - EP11 - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\blur5}もう過去に置いてく
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.60,0:22:55.52,ED - JP - EP11 - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)\blur5}私は私のままでいたい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.52,0:22:57.73,ED - JP - EP11 - Shad,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(300,300)\blur5}Crossing every sea, running free
